  id: prologue.berries
  displayName: Berries for the Pot
  description: 'Eirik says nobody fights well on an empty stomach. There are berries in the clearing west of the shelter: pick five and stew them over the fire in his waterskin. Whatever is out there won''t wait for ever.'
  chain: Prologue - By the Fire
  journalNotes: 'Eirik is right about this, annoyingly. Hunger won''t kill you, but it will wear you down. A cooked meal does more than fill you: it gives you a bonus for a while.'
